{
  "slug": "convex",
  "name": "Convex",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Convex plugin for Claude Code with bundled Convex skills, the convex-expert subagent for code-writing, a runtime-error monitor, and MCP access for backend development, schema design, real-time features, auth, file storage, scheduled jobs, and AI agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills**, **2 agents**, **1 command**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `add` (Add a capability to the CURRENT Convex app — consults the served Convex capability catalog for always-current procedures…), `agent` (Add an AI agent / chatbot / RAG backend on Convex with @convex-dev/agent (durable threads, messages, tools, vector…), `auth` (Add authentication to the current Convex + web app — passkeys by default (OAuth/password optional), wired end to…), `billing` (Add Stripe billing/payments/subscriptions to a Convex app via @convex-dev/stripe — checkout action, auto-verified webhook, server-side subscription gating), `convex-authz` (Audit and harden a Convex app's authorization: identity-from-arg impersonation, missing per-document ownership checks, public queries leaking data by…), `crons` (Set up recurring scheduled jobs (crons) on Convex — digests, cleanups, polling, retries), `design` (Design and build reactive, type-safe, production-grade backends on Convex), `domains` (Wire a domain the user ALREADY OWNS (GoDaddy/Namecheap/Cloudflare/…) to their Convex app: exact DNS records, custom-domain attachment, auth-origin…), and 9 more\n- **Agents** (2): `convex-expert` (Convex backend specialist), `convex-reviewer` (Convex code reviewer — security, auth, validators, performance, and pattern checks for code in a convex/ directory)\n- **Commands** (1): `quickstart` (Scaffold a new Convex app from a one-sentence idea and build it live — a Next.js + shadcn…)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `convex`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install convex@claude-plugins-official` from `get-convex/convex-backend-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
